{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01638","headline":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命三首 二 · 李端","name":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉垒城边争走马，铜蹏市里共乘舟。\n鸣环动佩思无尽，掩袖低巾泪不流。\n畴昔将歌邀客醉，如今欲舞对君羞。\n忍怀贱妾平生曲，独上襄阳旧酒楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}